# Google Places API (New) — used by lib/google-reviews.ts to fetch this
# business's real 5-star Google reviews for the homepage testimonials
# section and the MedicalBusiness JSON-LD aggregateRating/review fields.
#
# - Server-only. Never prefix with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
# - GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY is preferred; GOOGLE_API_KEY is used as a
#   fallback if only that is set.
# - One Google Cloud project/key can be reused across client sites; only
#   GOOGLE_PLACE_ID changes per client.
# - Requires "Places API (New)" enabled + billing on the Google Cloud
#   project, and a quota cap of 1,000 calls/month on
#   "Place Details Enterprise + Atmosphere" is recommended.
GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=
GOOGLE_API_KEY=

# This client's Google Place ID (starts with "ChIJ..."). Find it via
# Google Maps > this listing > Share, or the Place ID Finder:
# https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/javascript/examples/places-placeid-finder
GOOGLE_PLACE_ID=
